t":"Nyingi ng'a? asks for your name.","id":"reply-task","prompt":"Someone asks you \"Nyingi ng'a?\". Which reply fits?"}},{"id":"pack.dholuo.market-conversation-say","kind":"speaking_prompt","prompt":"Introduce yourself aloud with Nyinga … and Aa ki …"}],"format":"guided_conversation","id":"pack.dholuo.market-conversation","linkedPhraseIds":[],"objective":"Follow Otieno meeting a visitor, then pick the reply to a name question.","prerequisiteLessonIds":[],"requiredActivityIds":["pack.dholuo.market-conversation-t1","pack.dholuo.market-conversation-t2","pack.dholuo.market-conversation-t3","pack.dholuo.market-conversation-t4","pack.dholuo.market-conversation-t5","pack.dholuo.market-conversation-t6","pack.dholuo.market-conversation-t7","pack.dholuo.market-conversation-reply"],"revision":1,"title":"A visitor in Kisumu"},{"activities":[{"examples":["Achiel, ariyo, adek, ang'wen, abich (1–5)","Nyingi ng'a? (What's your name?) → Nyinga … (My name is …)"],"explanation":"Counting from one to five: achiel, ariyo, adek, ang'wen, abich. Ten is apar. Separately, nyingi (your name) and nyinga (my name) differ only in their ending.","id":"pack.dholuo.market-pattern-explain","kind":"pattern_explanation"},{"id":"pack.dholuo.market-pattern-build-1","kind":"ordered_tokens","task":{"acceptedSequences":[["tok2","tok4","tok1","tok5","tok3"]],"feedbackCorrect":"Right: achiel, ariyo, adek, ang'wen, abich.","feedbackIncorrect":"Start with achiel (one).","id":"build-1-task","prompt":"Put one to five in order.","tokens":[{"occurrenceId":"tok1","text":"Adek"},{"occurrenceId":"tok2","text":"Achiel"},{"occurrenceId":"tok3","text":"Abich"},{"occurrenceId":"tok4","text":"Ariyo"},{"occurrenceId":"tok5","text":"Ang'wen"}]}},{"id":"pack.dholuo.market-pattern-build-2","kind":"ordered_tokens","task":{"acceptedSequences":[["tok2","tok1"]],"feedbackCorrect":"Right: Nyingi ng'a?","feedbackIncorrect":"Nyingi (your name) comes first.","id":"build-2-task","prompt":"Ask someone their name.","tokens":[{"occurre